{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/pulls/283","id":5226057489,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSfdRcc8AAAABN39PEQ","html_url":"https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/pull/283","diff_url":"https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/pull/283.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/pull/283.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/issues/283","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/pulls/283/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/pulls/283/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/issues/283/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/statuses/407398160bb5761d90ade7182676dd76691617be","number":283,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"chore: release main","user":{"login":"szTheory","id":28652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory","html_url":"https://github.com/szTheory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":":robot: I have created a release *beep* *boop*\n---\n\n\n<details><summary>hex: 0.2.14</summary>\n\n## [0.2.14](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/hex-v0.2.13...hex-v0.2.14) (2026-11-09)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **release-candidate:** exclude Hex build_env provenance from the companion exact-public metadata digest ([fdc218f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/fdc218f94851676b925c4e3042e3567baf5b8391))\n* **release-candidate:** exclude Hex build_env provenance from the companion metadata digest after strict shape validation ([5b7e572](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/5b7e572ccaf04762f0e9b0806e6b12c1624984b4))\n* **release-candidate:** name each artifact's build_env Hex version in the proof logs ([be335ac](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/be335acc4580a7191fdd3fa5733331482b437f0c))\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>ios-core: 0.2.14</summary>\n\n## [0.2.14](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/ios-core-v0.2.13...ios-core-v0.2.14) (2026-11-09)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **196-03:** pin Swift vector executions with rebuilt resource controls ([b2dc413](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b2dc413269e3f94dee2a02dcdfa36122ae912ed3))\n* **196-04:** enforce metadata reader corpus availability ([d4a74cf](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d4a74cfc7804844bef275333314141dc9e9d2e12))\n* **196-04:** pin topology selection and inventory real readers ([75da76f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/75da76f2afd5153e63db1519b50be26544ca2613))\n* **196-04:** prove both Swift reply corpus cases ([28bb00b](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/28bb00b8a08d6d62ecc5e5dcbab6314ac86e89e3))\n* **198:** Android foreign-host proof, parity ledger and Kotlin test floor ([00adfd2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/00adfd23fb82ae97da2f0c0abb23b6d227791d1c))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **196:** make spec and structure ratchets fail on empty evidence ([88c8bdd](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/88c8bdd88c234c7d9c6b4cc8dbcc2fc9d63fe1be))\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>android-core: 0.2.14</summary>\n\n## [0.2.14](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/android-core-v0.2.13...android-core-v0.2.14) (2026-11-09)\n\n\n### Miscellaneous Chores\n\n* **android-core:** Synchronize crosswake versions\n</details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release Please](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please). See [documentation](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please#release-please).","labels":[{"id":11085776731,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfdRcc8AAAAClMOHWw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/labels/autorelease:%20pending","name":"autorelease: pending","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T15:05:33Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T21:32:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a53bf4af8b42d9154f0b5838fd835e98e9ecfa61","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"szTheory:release-please--branches--main","ref":"release-please--branches--main","repo":{"id":1240945009,"node_id":"R_kgDOSfdRcQ","name":"crosswake","full_name":"szTheory/crosswake","owner":{"login":"szTheory","id":28652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory","html_url":"https://github.com/szTheory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/received_events","type":"